OL,3,AVictims 'grossly failed' by sex
OL,4,Aoffender bail decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice said while the
OL,7,FCrown Prosecution Service had the right
OL,8,Fto challenge them, final bail decisions
OL,9,Fwere "made by the independent
OL,10,Fjudiciary".
